{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他现在在意的不是把期待继续推得更远，而是让自己已经承认过的靠近，在暂时收住、减少外露时仍然算数；因此这一小段更像把心意暂时放在手里看住，而不是撤回。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H3：他已经经历过明显表达期待之后的短暂不稳定，并形成了一个具体倾向——先不把已经承认过的心意作废。\",\"bridge\":\"这使他在表达突然变轻、变少时，不必立刻把这种收束解释成退意；他首先维持的是此前已经承认的靠近仍然有效。\",\"current\":\"所以m.35起的轻声和稀薄感，可以呈现为暂时减少外露而仍守着原先心意；到m.38重新出现较连续的参与，也无需被理解成重新作出决定，m.39的停留与渐弱仍属于同一份未撤销的靠近。\",\"without\":\"如果没有H3，这种突然变轻、变薄的阶段更容易只是一般性的迟疑或降温；正因为他已有“不因一阵不稳定就作废已承认心意”的经历，当前的收住才具有这种仍在维持的形态。\"},\"used\":[\"H3\"],\"new_history\":[],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"H3直接改变了对当前收束的解释：重点不是强度变小，而是已承认的靠近没有因暂时少表达而失效。没有把织体变化当作对方回应、关系变化或新的外部事件，也没有额外制造决定或领悟。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0da07a3d-5e0e-4750-814e-9964a1a9dc25", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214921866143Z", "elapsed_seconds": 14.438, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:49:36.312994+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "200e3ecd8c8984665316a8e7567357bce2cd9fbc5452975327d5a21af0a58da1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment